  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Emergency Response of IDPs and Returnees to South-East CAR Through the Coordination of Sites in Bangassou and its Axes and the Distribution of Emergency Shelters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to support the response of the multi-sectoral needs of internally displaced persons (IDPs) and returnees to South-East Central African Republic (CAR). IOM proposes to: 1) Support coordination of sites in and around Bangassou through data collection according to the Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) methodology, and 2) Provide shelter assistance to IDPs, returnees and host communities of the area through emergency shelter distribution.</narrative>
  </description>
